                        "glosses": [
                            "wad hook, two spiral blades arranged something like a corkscrew and fastened to a ramrod for extracting spherical objects from the bottom of a bore-hole",
                            "particularly a surgical implement to pull out bullets for someone afflicted by a gunshot wound"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
